{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:18OptiViewAdsRuntime17ContentLayoutLockC","symbolKind":"class","modules":[{"name":"OptiViewAdsRuntime"}],"role":"symbol","title":"ContentLayoutLock","roleHeading":"Class","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ContentLayoutLock"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ContentLayoutLock","kind":"identifier"}]},"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/ContentLayoutLock\/init(internalView:desiredFrame:restamp:)"],"title":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/ContentLayoutLock\/release()"],"title":"Instance Methods"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/ContentLayoutLock"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Pins a host player’s internal video surface to a fixed frame while the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"split-layout reflow has a transform installed on the host view (PLAYG-513).","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"final"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ContentLayoutLock"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Some RN host players (react-native-theoplayer) re-stamp their internal","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"player frame from the host view’s ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"frame","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" on every layout pass","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"THEOplayerRCTView.layoutSubviews","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" does ","type":"text"},{"code":"player.frame = self.frame","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"While the split transform is installed, the host view’s frame is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"transformed bounding box, so each pass applies the layout fraction to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"picture a SECOND time — the content renders at fraction² of its box — and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"drifts the picture out of the frozen content mask, exposing black regions","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"inside the box. react-native-video is immune: its layout stamps sublayers","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from ","type":"text"},{"code":"bounds","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which a transform never changes.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The lock captures the healthy pre-transform frame at acquisition and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"re-asserts it (through the host’s own frame API, via ","type":"text"},{"code":"restamp","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") whenever","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the surface’s layer geometry deviates. Observed on the LAYER: UIView","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"geometry setters are not KVO-compliant, CALayer’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"bounds","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"code":"position","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"— the same technique as the overlay host view’s host-layer observers.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Construct on the main thread (it reads and may re-stamp view geometry);","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"release"},{"text":" only invalidates the observations and is safe from any thread.","type":"text"}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime\/contentlayoutlock"]}],"references":{"doc://optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime/documentation/OptiViewAdsRuntime/ContentLayoutLock/release()":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"release()","identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/ContentLayoutLock\/release()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"release"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime\/contentlayoutlock\/release()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Stops holding the frame. The host’s next layout pass re-stamps its own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"geometry from the (by then restored) host view frame."}],"type":"topic"},"doc://optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime/documentation/OptiViewAdsRuntime/ContentLayoutLock":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"ContentLayoutLock","identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/ContentLayoutLock","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ContentLayoutLock"}],"url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime\/contentlayoutlock","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ContentLayoutLock"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pins a host player’s internal video surface to a fixed frame while the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"split-layout reflow has a transform installed on the host view (PLAYG-513)."}],"type":"topic"},"doc://optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime/documentation/OptiViewAdsRuntime":{"role